<view class="tech-page"><tech-state wx:if="{{loading}}" loading /><tech-state wx:elif="{{error}}" error title="参与记录暂不可用" description="{{error}}" action="重新读取" bind:retry="load" /><block wx:elif="{{record}}"><view class="participation-seal"><van-icon name="passed" size="38px" /></view><view class="participation-title">本人服务参与记录</view><view class="participation-sub">历史留痕，服务有据可查</view><view class="tech-card"><view class="tech-summary-bar"><view class="tech-card__title">{{title}}维修</view><text class="tech-tag tech-tag--muted">{{statusText}}</text></view><view class="tech-caption">{{record.workOrderNo}}</view><view class="tech-divider" /><view class="tech-row"><text class="tech-row__label">首次参与</text><text class="tech-row__value">{{began}}</text></view><view class="tech-row"><text class="tech-row__label">参与结束</text><text class="tech-row__value">{{ended}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{record.cancellationFeeAmount || record.acceptanceText}}" class="tech-divider" /><view wx:if="{{record.cancellationFeeAmount}}" class="tech-text">应收上门费 ¥{{record.cancellationFeeAmount}}</view><view wx:elif="{{record.acceptanceText}}" class="tech-text">{{record.acceptanceText}}</view></view><view class="tech-notice tech-notice--blue"><van-icon name="shield-o" /><text>此处仅展示本人参与摘要，客户姓名、联系方式、地址和照片均已隐藏。</text></view></block><button class="tech-btn tech-btn--outline" bindtap="onBack">返回维修工作台</button></view>
